# UI libraries

When editing under `libs/**/ui/**/`.

## Scope

- Applies to: @ libs/**/ui/**/\*

## Conventions

use the custom nx generator to create valid ui libraries via the angular-lib generator.

The presentational components should be stateless, take inputs and send signal outputs.
